INFO  2026-04-26T22:58:24 +0ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_dcbfb79030014P1fq0HBPH1Mpf key=naming_convention value=## Naming Conventions
```text
Files:
- Components: PascalCase (Header.tsx, Watchlist.tsx)
- Utilities: camelCase (useStockData.ts, utils.ts)
- Types: kebab-case with .ts suffix (stock.ts)
- Tests: *.test.ts suffix

React Components:
- Component names: PascalCase
- Props interfaces: {ComponentName}Props
- Hook names: use{PascalCase}

API Routes:
- Route files: kebab-case (stock.ts, watchlist.ts)
- Endpoint paths: /api/{resource}/:param/{action}

CSS/Tailwind:
- Use Tailwind utility classes
- Custom colors via design tokens
- Responsive prefixes: sm:, md:, lg:
